{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261029/photo/bkn-20261029093654714-1029_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261029103336\"/><p>警員到場調查。（吳鎮興攝）</p><p>新蒲崗發生爆竊。今晨(29日)9時21分，爵祿街35號百勝工廠大廈一間製衣公司，職員上班發現後門被撬毀，公司有被搜掠痕迹，懷疑被賊人爆竊。警員到場調查，將案件列作「爆竊」處理，損失金額有待進一步點算。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T02:41:14.962020+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T01:36:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T04:38:40.426511+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T02:38:30.407617+00:00","content_hash":"5b70f2e9dd5882cf9cc332a49b91269aad1ada90cd170379bae96c5863a368fb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}